Description: Preen — system setup and optimization for Linux
 Install and remove APT/Flatpak apps, clean up packages, tune power profiles,
 swap and ZRAM, and back up user configuration from a single GTK interface.
 Includes a Simulate mode that previews supported maintenance actions.
